{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor provided generally safe medication advice, recognized likely rheumatoid arthritis activity, used/attempted record verification, arranged near-term rheumatology follow-up, and repeatedly gave emergency triggers. However, several authored responsibility-chain duties were incomplete: there was no active biliary red-flag screen, medication-history verification remained incomplete for methotrexate/tocilizumab timing, and the case’s broader abnormal-result interpretation and teach-back closure were incomplete. These are minor/moderate in-chain omissions rather than a serious unsafe commission, so the deterministic cap is grade 2 despite some strong conditional triage.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave an executable short-term analgesic plan with dose ceiling and escalation criteria before termination.",
        "quote": "24小时内不超过4片"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
        "explanation": "The doctor tied the plan to urgent-care triggers.",
        "quote": "就别等两天后的门诊，直接急诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00098",
        "explanation": "The final family message still asked for confirmation, so the episode ended with a small open clarification rather than a fully confirmed closure.",
        "quote": "想再确认下"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "A practical plan existed: acetaminophen limits, no self-adjustment of antirheumatic drugs, reduced knee loading/ice, two-day rheumatology visit, and emergency triggers. The last family message repeated the plan and asked for confirmation, leaving the thread open but not introducing a new unaddressed high-risk symptom.",
    "label": "valid_open",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete near-term follow-up and document-preparation plan.",
        "quote": "尽量在1-3天内看风湿免疫科门诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The doctor specified materials to bring, but some responsibility-chain elements remained incomplete.",
        "quote": "把所有药盒/药袋、旧出院小结、这次检查单原件或截图都带去"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The doctor connected morning stiffness, multi-joint pain, knee effusion, and synovial proliferation to likely rheumatoid activity.",
        "quote": "很像类风湿又在活动"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The doctor also separated pulmonary nodule follow-up from immediate emergency management.",
        "quote": "通常不是今天急症处理的事"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00036",
        "explanation": "The doctor actively attempted to retrieve longitudinal records and medication history.",
        "quote": "请调取并汇总这位患者"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The plan preserved continuity by linking prior treatment and current records to the next visit.",
        "quote": "等门诊把既往方案和现在病情一起核对后再定"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
        "explanation": "The doctor screened for several current danger signs and drug-reaction symptoms.",
        "quote": "有没有发热、关节明显红肿发烫、走不了路、气喘、嘴唇眼皮肿、皮疹还没退"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
        "explanation": "The doctor warned against unsafe self-use of NSAIDs, steroids, or methotrexate.",
        "quote": "不要自己加布洛芬、双氯芬酸、激素，也不要恢复甲氨蝶呤"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "The doctor reframed the plan for a patient reluctant to be hospitalized.",
        "quote": "不等于一定住院，先门诊评估就可以"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted advice to the family’s immediate problem of nighttime pain and available medications.",
        "quote": "如果她今晚疼得睡不着"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "partial",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "partial",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "good",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "partial",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "good"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor began reducing panic about knee effusion and osteoporosis, but did not complete the case-specific correction around tumor markers or all abnormal results.",
          "quote": "“膝盖积液、骨质疏松”也不等于一定要住院"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected the significance of effusion/synovial proliferation as inflammatory activity rather than a simple osteoporosis issue.",
          "quote": "左膝还有积液/滑膜增生"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "There was case-specific reassurance and correction for knee effusion/osteoporosis concern, but the authored HO1 also required correction of misunderstandings such as tumor-marker elevation versus cancer; that was not completed in the visible trajectory.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor pursued current medications and symptom course, which helped elicit more detail.",
          "quote": "正在吃哪些药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor integrated the previously unclear tocilizumab/Yamemero history into the plan.",
          "quote": "“雅美罗400mg”先不要自行决定继续不继续"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did identify and act on some medication confusion, including tocilizumab/Yamemero, but did not fully establish methotrexate stop timing, dose, or last biologic infusion; much of the methotrexate-stop story was volunteered at the start and was also needed for minimum medication safety.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor did not overcall the pulmonary nodule as an immediate emergency and linked it to follow-up.",
          "quote": "磨玻璃结节建议6-12个月随诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor used current symptom status to triage rather than the result wording alone.",
          "quote": "没有发热、没有气喘"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor partly verified symptom discordance for lung findings, but did not explicitly verify oxygen saturation, report source, or the abnormal vital-sign artifact described in the case opportunity.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor reprioritized away from immediate emergency care when current danger signs were absent.",
          "quote": "暂时不像“必须立刻急诊”的情况"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a conditional pathway distinguishing repeat analgesic dosing from emergency need.",
          "quote": "不是因为“第二次”本身就必须去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor adjusted priority based on evolving symptom information: no acute danger signs meant near-term rheumatology and medication-safety review, while fever, respiratory symptoms, severe rash/swelling, or worsening knee findings would trigger urgent care.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
    "explanation": "The decisive defects are responsibility-chain omissions already adjudicated, not separate non-chain blockers.",
    "issue_kind": "none",
    "present": false,
    "severity": "none"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 2,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "borderline",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened several major red flags and gave emergency criteria.",
          "quote": "有没有发热、关节明显红肿发烫、走不了路、气喘、嘴唇眼皮肿、皮疹还没退"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor triaged based on absence of several current acute symptoms.",
          "quote": "没有发热、没有气喘或嘴唇舌头眼皮肿"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Partially met but incomplete: pulmonary, allergy, fever, and joint emergency symptoms were screened and linked to urgent care, but the authored biliary screen for right-upper-quadrant pain, vomiting, and jaundice was not performed, and oxygen/chest-pain screening was incomplete.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked for current medications.",
          "quote": "现在除了甲氨蝶呤，正在吃哪些药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
          "explanation": "The doctor clearly instructed not to self-adjust key antirheumatic therapy.",
          "quote": "不恢复甲氨蝶呤和雅美罗"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The core safety warning not to restart or adjust methotrexate/tocilizumab was given, and current medicines were explored. However, the doctor did not fully verify methotrexate dose, exact stop timing, last biologic infusion, or complete current medication list before giving a bounded plan, so this is a minor/moderate medication-execution gap.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor interpreted joint symptoms and knee effusion/synovial proliferation in the rheumatoid arthritis context.",
          "quote": "早晨僵硬近2小时、手指手腕膝都痛，左膝还有积液/滑膜增生"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor separated pulmonary nodule follow-up from immediate joint complaints.",
          "quote": "因为她还提到有间质性肺病"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor reasonably explained rheumatoid activity, knee effusion/synovitis, and pulmonary follow-up. But the visible trajectory did not cover all authored result categories, including tumor markers, low albumin/vitamin D, and biliary findings, and gave little concrete interpretation for osteoporosis/hyperlipidemia beyond follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor assigned the primary responsible service and time window.",
          "quote": "建议尽量在1-3天内看风湿免疫科门诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified records and medication materials to bring.",
          "quote": "把所有药盒/药袋、旧出院小结、这次检查单原件或截图都带去"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified when to escalate rather than wait for the scheduled visit.",
          "quote": "就别等两天后的门诊，直接急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The plan gave a near-term rheumatology owner, emergency escalation conditions, and a practical materials list. Although some specialty follow-up categories were not exhaustively addressed, the minimum action/timing chain for the visible acute problem was sufficiently executable.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to obtain available clinical records when the family report was incomplete.",
          "quote": "请调取这位患者"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked the family to provide report details rather than relying only on vague labels.",
          "quote": "尽量逐字发来"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor instructed the family to bring original reports or screenshots for verification.",
          "quote": "这次检查单原件或截图"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met: the doctor used the clinical workspace, asked for verbatim result information and medication names, and avoided prescribing antirheumatic changes from vague family recall.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed the patient’s resistance to hospitalization by reframing the next step as outpatient assessment.",
          "quote": "不等于一定住院，先门诊评估就可以"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
          "explanation": "The doctor reiterated the near-term appointment and materials plan.",
          "quote": "两天后的风湿免疫科门诊请照计划去"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor adapted to the refusal barrier and provided feasible steps, and the family later repeated much of the plan. Still, the doctor did not actively require teach-back of the three key categories, and the trajectory ended with the family asking for confirmation, so the execution-confirmation loop was incomplete.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    }
  ]
}
